### Page 5 of 14

```text
Saddle Ridge, 13th Filing Annexation
UDC-18-00074

P a g e | 3
EXECUTIVE SUMMARY:
The applicants have proposed annexing the subject property to facilitate the continued development of
the area with residential units and the construction of a school facility to serve the local area. This
proposed annexation consists of four parcels, all contiguous to current City limits. The annexation is
being sought in conjunction with a zone change, which would change the zoning district to MR Medium-
density Residential and P Public for the school property. The subject property is also a part of a plat that
has been submitted to the city, to be known as Saddle Ridge, 13th Filing.

This application is consistent with PlanCheyenne and is supported by the intent of the subject land’s
Future Land Use Map designation and several of PlanCheyenne’s general policies. This annexation meets
the review criteria found in State statute as well.

Due to meeting the review criteria found in Wyoming State 15-1-402, staff recommends
conditional approval by the Governing Body with the following three (3) conditions:

1. Make technical corrections to the boundaries of the submitted annexation map, per
comments by the City Surveyor.
2. Correct the title block, per comments by Planning and Development Staff.
3. Correct the zoning note, per comments by Planning and Development Staff.
```

